        </p>

        <h2>The Pristine Operating System</h2>
        <p>
          The initial Earth server was a marvel of thermodynamic efficiency. It was designed to operate as a "Living Library"—an open-source biological repository where the genetic acoustics of countless star systems could be synthesized and expressed in physical density.
        </p>

        <blockquote class="anu-blockquote anu-blockquote-silver">
