        </blockquote>

        <h2>The Archontic Hijack</h2>
        <p>
          The perfection of the Living Library made it a high-value target. The Archive records the subsequent event not as a moral "Fall from Grace," but as a hostile cybernetic incursion by a parasitic offshoot of consciousness: The Archons (or Demiurgic forces).
        </p>
        <p>
